OL,3,GNEWSAWales has an education crisis. Can
OL,4,Ait be fixed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales has an education crisis. Can it
OL,7,Fbe fixed?
OL,9,FAs you dip into the valley on the way
OL,10,Finto Merthyr Tydfil, a new earthy-toned
OL,11,Fbuilding dominates the view.
OL,13,FIt's the new site of Saint Carlo Acutis
OL,14,FCatholic School. With its rooftop
OL,15,Fscience garden, solar panels and
OL,16,Ffloor-to-ceiling windows, it's an
OL,17,Fimpressive sight.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
