OL,3,GNEWSAWales has an education crisis. Can
OL,4,Ait be fixed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FExcited staff and 940 pupils moved into
OL,7,Fthe #50m complex at the start of
OL,8,FSeptember. But they did so just as the
OL,9,FWelsh education system was being
OL,10,Fpainted in a less positive light, with
OL,11,FWales once again ranking the worst of
OL,12,FUK nations in global tests.
